            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Learn new languages: You will learn dozen of languages from your mother-in-game: Japanese, British English, American English, Cantonese, Minnan, Northeastern, Shanghainese and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover mysterious mothers: When you open the game, there is a chance that a mysterious mother will appear, such as a Japanese Yakuza mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Remote greetings with multiple players: Your mother can visit your friend’s mother and spend unforgettable time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Support &quot;Steam Workshop&quot;: create your favourite mother character. <br> <br>Instructions: <br>-Click the character to open the menu. <br>-The character's gaze will follow the movement of your mouse. <br>-Supports character dragging (left mouse button) and zooming in and out (using the mouse wheel during dragging), but please do not block mother from watching TV. <br>-You can switch the screen where the character is located in a dual-screen situation through the following operations: &quot;win key&quot; + &quot;shift&quot; + left and right keys.  <br> <br>Join our community to receive more love and kindness from mothers. With your support, we can continue to make more games about moms.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Learn new languages: You will learn dozen of languages from your mother-in-game: Japanese, British English, American English, Cantonese, Minnan, Northeastern, Shanghainese and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover mysterious mothers: When you open the game, there is a chance that a mysterious mother will appear, such as a Japanese Yakuza mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Remote greetings with multiple players: Your mother can visit your friend’s mother and spend unforgettable time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Support &quot;Steam Workshop&quot;: create your favourite mother character. <br> <br>Instructions: <br>-Click the character to open the menu. <br>-The character's gaze will follow the movement of your mouse. <br>-Supports character dragging (left mouse button) and zooming in and out (using the mouse wheel during dragging), but please do not block mother from watching TV. <br>-You can switch the screen where the character is located in a dual-screen situation through the following operations: &quot;win key&quot; + &quot;shift&quot; + left and right keys.  <br> <br>Join our community to receive more love and kindness from mothers. With your support, we can continue to make more games about moms.</p>",
