                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Apparently Your Mother is on sale.\n>Opened mom\n>Opened cs2\n>Opened cases\n>Mom told me I was doing a good job\n>Lost 300€\n\n-Buys game\n-Able to say \"i bought your mother\"\n-Get 100% achievements\n-Able to say \"I 100%ed your mother\"\n\nGOTY material [Recommended 👍]\n\nA game where I can invite my friend’s mom? Finally, a true family drama simulator.\n\nThe multiplayer experience is something else. The more friends you have, the more moms you can invite. At some point, it stops feeling like a game and starts resembling an unexpected family gathering. The achievement system is also… unique. Spending \"30 minutes with a different mom\" doesn’t sound like a challenge—it sounds like a headline that could ruin your reputation.\n\nThe gameplay is disturbingly realistic. I invited my friend’s mom through Steam, and somehow she materialized in my room, told me to clean up, and gave me a life lecture. If that’s not peak immersion, I don’t know what is.\n\nThe only thing missing is a sequel called \"Your Father\", but just like in real life, I have a feeling it’s never going to be released.\nI love it when i'm playing any war themed game and just hear \"are you winning son\" in the background.\nmy whole life has lead up to this moment\n\n7살때 이혼한 첫번째 어머니, 12살때 런한 두번째 어머니, 고1때 썸만타고 도망친 세번째 어머니에 이어 진정으로 저를 아껴주는 4번째 어머니를 만났다. 최고의 게임. GOAT. [가슴이랑 엉덩이좀 크게]\n어머니가 한 분 더 생긴 느낌이라 좋음. 만일 어머니가 없으신 분이 계시다면 강추!! 엄마가 없어는대 생겨서 너무 좋음 행복함 ㅠㅠ\n어머니가 없어서 어머니를 단돈 1100원에 구매 했음.\n\nif your passing by you can pet this cat.\n정말 위대합니다, 선생!!\n内容很新颖 和电影 移动迷宫 很像，demo体量算不错了，\n　　　　 　 　 _ _\n　　　 　　／＞　　フ\n　　　 　　| 　_　 _ l\n　 　　 　／` ミ＿xノ\n　　 　 /　　　 　 |\n　　　 /　 ヽ　　 ﾉ\n　 　 │　　|　|　|\n　／￣|　　 |　|　|\n　| (￣ヽ＿_ヽ_)__)\n　＼二つ",
